      <activity id="a367625d-08e1-55d2-be16-a113c9dadda9" activityNameId="cdf33412-7ce7-5b4c-b995-f165895c7596" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood-metal, opaquely painted, casement cover, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood-metal, opaquely painted, casement cover, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: 24e7385b-fe76-3a6a-b139-3e74b53a0f4a
Only for internal use! Included are the materials used in a wooden-metal window frame with surface treatment and the panelling of the casement. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_24e7385b-fe76-3a6a-b139-3e74b53a0f4a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
